    "source": "https://build.protomaps.com/20261031.pmtiles",
    "note": "Legacy Kollam Junction exterior interpreted from the documented 2017-01-08 frontage with the older plan retained in 20261031 PMTiles. Hidden elevations and platform and bridge sections are medium-fi estimates. The station uses a terrain-derived 16.72 m grade in the dated view. The present-day view retains map-derived geometry.",
